{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_086E20","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Mother Base决定举办一场小小的庆典。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":47,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"据说是因为Snake他们平日总在战斗，至少一年一次，想悠闲地度过一个和平的日子。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":110,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"我不太清楚事情的来龙去脉，只听说Snake和Miller商量后就这么决定了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":92,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"大家都赞成。Mother Base本来就没多少娱乐，谁都会欢迎这种活动吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":89,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"这倒是无所谓，可我怎么不知不觉间也被安排上台唱歌了……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"Miller说：“我们的名字意思不是一样嘛——都是‘和平’。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"“还有Zadornov那家伙，他的名字不也和和平有关吗？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"Miller的主张是：“难得有个和平日，就以‘和平三人组’的名义组个乐队吧。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"Miller连我的意见都没问，就已经把这件事告诉了所有人，于是我唱歌也成了板上钉钉的事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"看来Miller以前听到过我在甲板上唱歌，从那以后就一直想组乐队。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"士兵们也都很期待，事到如今看来是没法拒绝了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"我从没在人前唱过歌，不过被大家期待着，感觉倒也不坏。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"不过很显然，总比Miller来唱要强吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"可是，<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>的改造已经完成了。我必须完成自己的使命。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":82,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"如果背叛<R=CIPHER,CIPHER>，我恐怕会尝到比死亡更加可怕的绝望。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=CIPHER,CIPHER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":83,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"可是……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"现在应该还没必要立刻执行计划。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"稍微推迟一点行动，应该也不会有什么问题吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"难得有这样一个和平日……。等到那一天过去之后再行动，不也可以吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"也许，我只是在把问题往后拖而已。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"等那一天到来，无论如何，我和Snake之中都会有一个人死去。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":80,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"即便如此……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"至少等到和平日为止……。只要想办法对<R=CIPHER,CIPHER>撒个谎……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=CIPHER,CIPHER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":89,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"不知为什么，我竟开始考虑起这种事来……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""}]}